## 1. Category map

Claude Design extracts and re-exposes exactly four categories. Every field
this bundle emits must trace to one of them (or to the drop-silent axis,
which is documented in `upload-checklist.md § schema-projection-report`).

| Claude Design (zh-TW) | Claude Design (EN) | This bundle — `design.md §` | This bundle — `design.tokens.yaml §` | This bundle — generated file |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 色彩調色板 | Color palette | § 4.1 Color + § 5 Semantic Tokens | `color.*`, `color.semantic.*`, `color.dark.*` | — |
| 排版 | Typography | § 4.3 Typography | `typography.families`, `typography.scale.*` | — |
| 元件 | Components | § 6 Components | `components.*` | — |
| 版面配置模式 | Layout patterns | § 4.4 Spacing & Layout + § (per-page) | `spacing`, `layout.base`, `layout.page.*`, `layout.breakpoints` | — |

